    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You shed bright light in a 30-foot-radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. You are immune to fire damage. Melee attacks you make deal an additional [[/damage 1d8 fire]] damage. When you deal fire damage to a flammable creature or object, you can choose whether it ignites—an ignited target takes [[/damage 1d10 fire average]] damage at the start of each of its turns until a creature uses an action to douse it. Your GM determines what constitutes a flammable creature or object.</p>",
